name: Data Entity
canonical_in_docs: true
canonical_candidate: false
description: 'The platform''s unit of metadata — datasets, transformers, consumers,
  quality tests, groups, and inputs — addressable by ODDRN. The central domain object
  spanning catalog navigation, lineage, alerts, ownership, tags, terms, descriptions,
  status, metadata, and discussions. **Batch F** completed the centerpiece-read +
  ownership-binding + status-lifecycle + lineage-graph surface; **Batch H** adds the
  PRIMARY-SOURCE persistence layer via ReactiveDataEntityRepositoryImpl (982 lines,
  35+ public methods) — the SQL-level confirmation of every batch-F + batch-G finding:
  (a) STATUS-column soft-delete OVERRIDE of the inherited deleted_at base (lines 109-123);
  (b) EXCLUDE_FROM_SEARCH inconsistency confirmed at the cteDataEntitySelect helper
  (lines 909-939 omit predicate; lines 448, 974 apply it) — REFACTOR-222 is now SQL-primary-source;
  (c) view_count increment at lines 173-180 with no rate-limit, no idempotency, no
  index on view_count (full-table scan + top-N sort for /popular); (d) verbatim description
  storage at lines 430-438 — F-004 fingerprint; (e) **NEW SQL-injection vector at
  lines 799-806** — `getHighlightedResult` interpolates user-controllable text +
  query via `String.formatted(...)` into raw SQL (HIGH severity, only raw-SQL-format
  path in the file); (f) repository has NO @ReactiveTransactional — atomicity delegated
  to caller service-layer.'
