  callers (DataEntityServiceImpl.@ReactiveTransactional at lines 197, 324). **SECURITY-HIGH**:
  SQL-injection vector in getHighlightedResult (lines 799-806; String.formatted into
  raw SQL with user-controllable text + tsQuery; JooqFTSHelper.tsQuery does NOT escape
  single-quotes). **SECURITY-MEDIUM**: owner-scoping BYPASSED at JOIN time (every
  method signature lacks principal/owner parameter; ReactiveDataEntityRepository.java:1-119
  interface confirms). **REFACTOR-222 PRIMARY-SOURCE CONFIRMED**: cteDataEntitySelect
  OMITS EXCLUDE_FROM_SEARCH (lines 909-939) vs getDataEntityDefaultConditions APPLIES
  it (line 974) — affects listPopular / listByOwner / listByTerm / getDimensions(id|oddrns|ids)
  / getDetails(id) / getQuerySuggestions; findByState re-applies via JooqFTSHelper.resultFacetStateConditions
  (line 149). **PERFORMANCE-HIGH**: no index on view_count, full-table scan + top-N
  sort per /popular call. **TEST-ZERO**: zero direct test coverage of ReactiveDataEntityRepositoryImpl
  (verified by exhaustive grep — no DataEntityRepositoryTest exists at any test layer);
  highest-stake regression site is the EXCLUDE_FROM_SEARCH inconsistency drift +
  the soft-delete STATUS override + the SQL-injection vector in getHighlightedResult.'
