performance_aggregate:
  overall: LOW
  hot_paths:
  - '**GET /api/dataentities/{id} (getDataEntityDetails) — single hottest endpoint
    on the platform; batch F primary-source detailed**: 1 CTE select (multi-JOIN over
    data_entity + namespace + datasource + entity-class join) + 5 parallel reactive
    lookups (enrich-class: dependencies + last-task-runs + DEG-children + DEG-children-count
    + consumers-count) + 1 parent-DEG lookup + 4 parallel reactive lookups (enrich-details:
    metadata + dataset-versions + terms + tags) + 1 UPDATE view_count → ~10 reactive
    sub-queries per call. No caching, no `@Cacheable`, no ETag, no `Cache-Control`.
    Every page-mount, tab-switch, deep-link, refresh hits this. (getDataEntityDetails.md:performance.hot_paths.[0])'
